{{define "main"}}
<section class="px-gutter py-12 md:py-16">
    <article class="mx-auto max-w-4xl">
        <div class="mb-6 rounded-xl border-2 border-amber-500 bg-amber-50 p-5 text-amber-950" role="alert">
            <p class="font-label text-label-md font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">Draft — not approved for publication</p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-body-sm">This placeholder is not a formal vulnerability disclosure program. The scope and response commitments must be confirmed before publication.</p>
        </div>
        <h1 class="font-headline text-4xl text-on-background md:text-display-md">Security Disclosure</h1>
        <p class="mt-4 text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">Tabiri Analytics welcomes responsible reports about potential security issues affecting this website.</p>

        <div class="mt-10 space-y-8 text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">
            <section>
                <h2 class="font-headline text-headline-sm text-on-background">Reporting a concern</h2>
                <p class="mt-3">Report a potential issue to <a class="text-primary underline" href="mailto:savannah.kadima@tabirianalytics.com">savannah.kadima@tabirianalytics.com</a>, our monitored security reporting contact. Please do not include passwords, personal data, customer information, or other sensitive material in your initial report.</p>
            </section>
            <section>
                <h2 class="font-headline text-headline-sm text-on-background">Responsible research</h2>
                <p class="mt-3"><strong>For review:</strong> define authorized scope, testing limitations, prohibited actions, safe-harbor terms if offered, and any coordination or disclosure expectations. Do not assume authorization to test any system from this draft.</p>
            </section>
            <section>
                <h2 class="font-headline text-headline-sm text-on-background">Response process</h2>
                <p class="mt-3"><strong>For review:</strong> identify the team responsible for triage, acknowledgement targets, remediation coordination, and public disclosure decisions. Do not publish response-time commitments until operationally approved.</p>
            </section>
        </div>
    </article>
</section>
{{end}}
